FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.26@sha256:0d1d3a794be25f809dd2cb3160d8c73276c4056a9f8242a138e908ddeee7b6b6 AS builder
ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH

WORKDIR /workspace
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download

COPY . .
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=$TARGETOS GOARCH=$TARGETARCH go build -trimpath -o /plugin ./main.go

FROM gcr.io/distroless/static:nonroot@sha256:f7f8f729987ad0fdf6b05eeeae94b26e6a0f613bdf46feea7fc40f7bd72953e6
COPY --from=builder /plugin /plugin
USER 10001:10001
ENTRYPOINT ["/plugin"]
